# Generated render fixtures.
#
# These are build outputs, not sources. The full payload is ~170 MB and the
# lean city scene ~25 MB, and both are reproduced exactly by:
#   cargo run --release -p wind-water-terrain-lab --example city_fixture -- --cities 1
#   cargo run --release -p wind-water-terrain-lab --example tiny_city
# Committing them would put a quarter of a gigabyte of derived vertex data in the
# history for no benefit, and every regeneration would rewrite them.
/public/render-fixture.json
/public/city-scenes.json
/public/tiny-city.json
/public/tiny-baseline.json
